### 3. 并发分支 A：在 category_id 下发布文章 A
# @depends-on 02_init_data.http
# @name PublishPostA
GET https://httpbingo.org/get?post_title=article_rust_async&category={{category_id}}

# 验证继承了 category_id 和 Cookie，并捕获文章 A 的 ID (模拟为 article_rust_async)
@assert status == 200
@assert body.args.category.0 == "category_tech"
@assert body.headers.Cookie.0 contains "session_token=jwt_complex_flow_999"
@assert body.headers.Cookie.0 contains "tenant_id=tenant_east_01"
@capture post_id_a from body.args.post_title.0
